#: ../../source/docs/modules/tuneopt.rst:3 c1487434512241fcb35443fc717949ee
msgid "Tuning Options"
msgstr "调参选项"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/tuneopt.rst:9 80ef8369815046b19f8a4c7733358be6
msgid ""
"This module manages the action mapped to channel 6. It is used for "
"multicopters only. Use ``tuneopt [set|show|reset|list]`` to manage the "
"mapped action. For the ``set`` command, use the format ``tuneopt set "
"[OPTION] [LOW] [HIGH]`` to map a tuning action and its range of values."
msgstr ""
"此模块管理映射到通道6的操作，仅适用于多旋翼飞行器。使用 ``tuneopt [set|show|reset|list]`` 管理映射的操作。对于 "
"``set`` 命令，使用格式 ``tuneopt set [OPTION] [LOW] [HIGH]`` 来映射调参操作及其取值范围。"
